 for leases with an initial term of 12 months or less, referred to as short term leases, on a straight-line basis over the lease term.</span></p><div style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_c2c48100-9c02-465e-88ce-87a54616ef25" contextRef="C_b68ab883-81f5-46b7-856d-6aa1e8f3e730" name="oesx:SummaryOfAssetsLeasedFromThirdPartiesTableTextBlock" escape="true"><p style="margin-left:4.133%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:9pt;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">A summary of Orion&#8217;s assets leased from third parties follows (dollars in thousands):</span></p>
