which the Company reports a net loss, potentially dilutive securities are excluded from the dilution calculation. </span><span><ix:nonNumeric id="F_35792060-f951-4a1e-87e4-33de3d9abfcb" contextRef="C_b68ab883-81f5-46b7-856d-6aa1e8f3e730" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfEarningsPerShareBasicAndDilutedTableTextBlock" escape="true" continuedAt="F_35792060-f951-4a1e-87e4-33de3d9abfcb_1"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Net income (loss) per common share is calculated based upon the following shares:</span></ix:nonNumeric></span></p><div style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:continuation id="F_35792060-f951-4a1e-87e4-33de3d9abfcb_1"><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p>
